### `me` as a Decimal, rounded to 34 digits (a tie as {Decimal} rounds one) when it has more.
### :returns: The decimal.
routine U8.to[Decimal]() -> Decimal
    return Decimal.of(dec_of_integer(neg: false, magnitude: me.to[U256](), f: decimal_format()))

### `me` as a Decimal, rounded to 34 digits (a tie as {Decimal} rounds one) when it has more.
### :returns: The decimal.
routine U16.to[Decimal]() -> Decimal
